@page "/manage/mobs"
@attribute [Authorize]
@* Interaktivní režim per stránka — layout zůstává SSR; bez toho by @onclick a @bind nefungovaly *@
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@inject IDbService Db

<PageTitle>@S["ManageMobsPageTitle"] — Metin2Bausia</PageTitle>

<h2>@S["ManageMobsTitle"]</h2>
<p class="text-muted mb-3">@((MarkupString)S["ManageMobsIntroHtml"].Value)</p>

<div class="toolbar mb-3 d-flex gap-2 align-items-center flex-wrap">
    <input class="form-control form-control-sm" style="max-width:220px"
           placeholder="@S["SearchNameVnum"]"
           @bind="_search" @bind:event="oninput" @bind:after="ResetPage" />

    <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm" role="group">
        <button class="btn @(_tab=="all"?"btn-primary":"btn-outline-secondary")"
                @onclick='() => SelectTab("all")'>@S["All"]</button>
        <button class="btn @(_tab=="monster"?"btn-danger":"btn-outline-secondary")"
                @onclick='() => SelectTab("monster")'>@S["TabMonsters"]</button>
        <button class="btn @(_tab=="npc"?"btn-info":"btn-outline-secondary")"
                @onclick='() => SelectTab("npc")'>NPC</button>
        <button class="btn @(_tab=="metin"?"btn-warning":"btn-outline-secondary")"
                @onclick='() => SelectTab("metin")'>@S["TabMetins"]</button>
        <button class="btn @(_tab=="boss"?"btn-dark":"btn-outline-secondary")"
                @onclick='() => SelectTab("boss")'>@S["TabBosses"]</button>
    </div>

    <select class="form-select form-select-sm" style="max-width:140px" @bind="_filterEnabled" @bind:after="ResetPage">
        <option value="">@S["All"]</option>
        <option value="true">@S["Enabled"]</option>
        <option value="false">@S["Disabled"]</option>
    </select>

    <span class="text-muted small ms-auto">@S["ShownOf", Filtered.Count(), _mobs.Count]</span>
</div>

@if (_loading)
{
    <p>@S["Loading"]</p>
}
else
{
    <div class="table-responsive list-table">
        <table class="table table-sm table-hover align-middle">
            <thead class="table-dark sticky-top">
                <tr>
                    <th style="width:56px">@S["On"]</th>
                    <SortableHeader Field="Vnum" Label="@S["ColVnum"]" @bind-SortBy="_sortBy" @bind-Ascending="_asc" OnSort="ResetPage" />
                    <SortableHeader Field="Name" Label="@S["ColName"]" @bind-SortBy="_sortBy" @bind-Ascending="_asc" OnSort="ResetPage" />
                    <th style="width:60px">@S["Level"]</th>
                    <th style="width:90px">@S["Type"]</th>
                    <th style="width:90px">@S["Rank"]</th>
                    <th style="width:100px">@S["Status"]</th>
                    <th style="width:50px"></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @foreach (var mob in Page)
                {
                    <tr class="@(mob.IsEnabled ? "" : "opacity-60")">
                        <td class="text-center">
                            <div class="form-check form-switch d-flex justify-content-center">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox"
                                       checked="@mob.IsEnabled"
                                       @onchange="e => ToggleAsync(mob, (bool)e.Value!)" />
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td><code class="small">@mob.Vnum</code></td>
                        <td>
                            <strong>@mob.Name</strong>
                            @if (mob.LocaleName != null)
                            { <small class="text-muted"> (@mob.LocaleName)</small> }
                        </td>
                        <td class="text-muted small">@mob.Level</td>
                        <td><span class="badge @ContentLabels.MobTypeBadge(mob.MobType)">@ContentLabels.MobType(mob.MobType)</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge @ContentLabels.RankBadge(mob.Rank)">@ContentLabels.Rank(mob.Rank)</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge @ContentLabels.StatusBadge(mob.ContentStatus)">@mob.ContentStatus</span></td>
                        <td><a href="/manage/mobs/@mob.Guid" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm py-0">→</a></td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    @* Mobil: osm sloupců se do 375 px nevejde, stejná data jdou pod sebe *@
    <div class="list-cards">
        @foreach (var mob in Page)
        {
            <div class="list-card @(mob.IsEnabled ? "" : "opacity-60")">
                <div class="form-check form-switch m-0">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox"
                           checked="@mob.IsEnabled"
                           @onchange="e => ToggleAsync(mob, (bool)e.Value!)" />
                </div>
                <a class="list-card__main" href="/manage/mobs/@mob.Guid">
                    <div class="list-card__title">@(mob.LocaleName ?? mob.Name)</div>
                    <div class="list-card__meta">
                        <code class="small">@mob.Vnum</code>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark">@S["Level"] @mob.Level</span>
                        <span class="badge @ContentLabels.MobTypeBadge(mob.MobType)">@ContentLabels.MobType(mob.MobType)</span>
                        <span class="badge @ContentLabels.RankBadge(mob.Rank)">@ContentLabels.Rank(mob.Rank)</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <span class="text-muted">›</span>
            </div>
        }
    </div>

    @if (TotalPages > 1)
    {
        <div class="mt-3">
            <Pager CurrentPage="_page" TotalPages="TotalPages" OnPageChanged="GoToPage" />
        </div>
    }
}

<ToastMessage Text="@ToastText" IsError="@ToastIsError" Stamp="@ToastStamp" />

@code {
    private bool _loading = true;
    private List<ManageMob> _mobs = new();
    private string _search = "";
    private string _tab = "all";
    private string _filterEnabled = "";
    private string _sortBy = "Vnum";
    private bool _asc = true;
    private int _page = 1;
    private const int PageSize = 50;

    private IEnumerable<ManageMob> Filtered => _mobs.Where(m =>
        (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_search) ||
            (m.Name?.Contains(_search, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) == true) ||
            (m.LocaleName?.Contains(_search, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) == true) ||
            (m.Vnum?.ToString() == _search)) &&
        (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterEnabled) || m.IsEnabled.ToString().ToLower() == _filterEnabled) &&
        _tab switch
        {
            "monster" => string.Equals(m.MobType, "monster", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase),
            "npc"     => string.Equals(m.MobType, "npc", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase),
            // Metiny: typ "metin" nebo klasický vnum rozsah 8001–8999, když typ chybí
            // Import z mob_proto.txt ukládá metiny jako STONE, admin UI jako metin
            "metin"   => string.Equals(m.MobType, "metin", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                         || string.Equals(m.MobType, "STONE", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                         || (m.Vnum >= 8001 && m.Vnum <= 8999),
            "boss"    => ContentLabels.IsBossRank(m.Rank),
            _         => true
        });

    private IEnumerable<ManageMob> Sorted =>
        _sortBy == "Name"
            ? (_asc ? Filtered.OrderBy(m => m.LocaleName ?? m.Name) : Filtered.OrderByDescending(m => m.LocaleName ?? m.Name))
            : (_asc ? Filtered.OrderBy(m => m.Vnum) : Filtered.OrderByDescending(m => m.Vnum));

    private int TotalPages => Math.Max(1, (int)Math.Ceiling(Filtered.Count() / (double)PageSize));

    // Stránkuje se až po filtrech — 5000 řádků v DOM zbytečně zatěžovalo mobil
    private IEnumerable<ManageMob> Page => Sorted.Skip((_page - 1) * PageSize).Take(PageSize);

    private void ResetPage() => _page = 1;

    private void GoToPage(int page) => _page = page;

    private void SelectTab(string tab) { _tab = tab; _page = 1; }

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        try
        {
            _mobs = (await Db.QueryAsync<ManageMob>(
                @"SELECT ""Guid"", ""Vnum"", ""Name"", ""LocaleName"", ""Level"",
                         ""MobType"", ""Rank"", ""ContentStatus"", ""IsEnabled"", ""SourceName""
                  FROM ""Mobs""
                  WHERE ""IsDeleted"" = FALSE
                  ORDER BY ""IsEnabled"" DESC, ""Vnum"" ASC NULLS LAST
                  LIMIT 5000")).ToList();
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { ShowError(ex); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private async Task ToggleAsync(ManageMob mob, bool newValue)
    {
        var old = mob.IsEnabled;
        mob.IsEnabled = newValue;
        try
        {
            await Db.ExecuteAsync(
                @"UPDATE ""Mobs"" SET ""IsEnabled"" = @v, ""IsEnabledLocked"" = TRUE, ""UpdatedAt"" = NOW() WHERE ""Guid"" = @g",
                new { v = newValue, g = mob.Guid });
            ShowOk(newValue ? S["TurnedOn", mob.Name ?? ""] : S["TurnedOff", mob.Name ?? ""]);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            mob.IsEnabled = old;
            ShowError(ex);
        }
    }

}
